 ('Storage benchmark qualification differs across categories','CPU tiled category times random physical buffers without a correctness hook; CMMA storage category checks a small independent reference before timing.',[D+'eval/gemm_cpu_tiled/mod.rs',D+'eval/gemm_storage/mod.rs',D+'eval/gemm.rs'],'CPU tiled doc reports historical10x/1.5x metrics, not fresh receipts. CMMA storage proof allows ValidationResult::Skipped alongside Pass despite prose saying proved before timed; actual skipped-result reachability needs shared validator trace. Its proof uses small64x256x256 shape with separately selected plan, not every timed plan. Timed storage tiling preparation and buffer allocation are outside/inside scopes as implemented.'),
